ラン（困り）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"E055D23D-117E-42B7-AD10-77EF9B446F26"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_071_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 71: シーン 72","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"「おいしい！」私は、思わずそう声を発する。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.072.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":4.239478458049886,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":3.6394784580498865,"slideTitle":"スライド #71","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"B2C627D0-5FFA-4581-B122-5F89DA54E6F2"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_072_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 72: シーン 73","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"「ふっ。」僕は、彼女のその仕草に思わず笑ってしまう。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.073.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":4.797369614512471,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.197369614512471,"slideTitle":"スライド #72","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第5話\/フラン（笑い）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"1C353680-894B-44FA-BD82-9D7D74E5F846"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_073_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 73: シーン 74","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"私はそれから、あっという間にごはんを食べ切ると彼を見る。\n「ねぇ、さっき買ってきたワインとグラスを出してくれない？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.074.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":8.791995464852608,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":8.191995464852608,"slideTitle":"スライド #73","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"2CAA9724-FCA4-4F09-BC04-5EE4206E9F6A"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_074_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 74: シーン 75","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"「いいですよ。ちょっと待ってください。」僕はそう言い、冷蔵庫にしまったワインを取り出してグラスに注ぐ。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.075.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":7.543038548752834,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.943038548752835,"seName":"SE: グラスにワインを注ぐ","slideTitle":"スライド #74","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/動画用\/音楽\/効果音\/グラスにワインを注ぐ.mp3","animationName":"なし","seVolume":0.85,"id":"5A6B9885-A706-4C3F-9898-832913EF2073"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_075_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 75: シーン 76","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"そして、ワインを注ぐと、彼女の前に置く。すると、彼女が僕の手を掴む。「あの、どうしたんですか？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.076.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":8.13,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.53,"slideTitle":"スライド #75","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"E196951A-FB32-4D80-86F7-27F8757F2B5D"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 76: シーン 77","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"そういうと、彼女は席を立ち、僕の隣に立つと、頬に何かが触れる感触がする。その途端に、強烈な恥ずかしさを僕は覚える。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.077.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":9.947369614512471,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":9.347369614512472,"slideTitle":"スライド #76","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"1D7F6765-699B-4171-891C-C77BC235E899"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 77: シーン 78","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"「どう、私からのキスは？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.078.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":2.794489795918367,"voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.194489795918367,"slideTitle":"スライド #77","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"C35EFD4D-D54E-4C55-A7B0-3C193B7475E3"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_078_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 78: シーン 79","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"彼女はワインを飲みながら、そう僕に聞く。\n「えっと…」僕は返すべき言葉が分からず、戸惑ってしまう。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.079.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":7.4354195011337865,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.835419501133787,"slideTitle":"スライド #78","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"BE540EB7-6BB7-413E-BB9F-8D6C45E47DB5"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 79: シーン 80","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"僕は、わずかに彼女と帰宅したことを、後悔した。だが、それよりも、彼女の表情やその声が頭の中に入り込んでくる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.080.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":9.490861678004535,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.890861678004535,"slideTitle":"スライド #79","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"A86936EC-FDF3-471F-BCFE-8C1D95F4B3CB"},{"characterName":"操夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_操夢.wav","title":"シーン 80: シーン 81","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpeg","telop":"「…少しばかし、恥ずかしいです…」僕は、そう返すのだった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.081.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","duration":4.774557823129252,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":4.174557823129252,"slideTitle":"スライド #80","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/フラン（余裕）.png","seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"A09E83C1-B582-478F-832D-4F1F57899710"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","title":"シーン 81: その頃、霊夢は…","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"単色背景","telop":"その頃、霊夢は…","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.082.jpeg","duration":3,"slideTitle":"スライド #81","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"45117B5D-4F10-436D-9D11-AFEC5D582C6C"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 82: シーン 83","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"私は、この取調室でふと今朝のことを思い出していた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.083.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":4.966984126984126,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":4.366984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #82","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"971E15E7-649A-4F0E-879D-D5E8AD9A7492"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_083_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 83: シーン 84","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc238754_一人部屋（日中）.jpg","telop":"私は、家を出てから、魔理沙の家に着くと、彼女は、ため息をつきながら、どこか暗く感じる表情をしていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.084.jpeg","duration":9.356984126984127,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":8.756984126984127,"slideTitle":"スライド #83","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"62B2AC62-D31D-4159-B37C-76AABE30333C"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_084_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 84: シーン 85","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc238754_一人部屋（日中）.jpg","telop":"私が、彼女にそんな表情をしている理由を問うと、昨晩の就寝時に、やけ酒をしていると、ふと不思議な声が聞こえたという。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.085.jpeg","duration":10.294489795918366,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.694489795918367,"slideTitle":"スライド #84","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"6C768884-3D85-4BFD-8F7C-AAE6E0A2C3DC"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_085_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 85: シーン 86","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc238754_一人部屋（日中）.jpg","telop":"そして、気がつけば、赤信号の横断歩道を渡っており、彼が止めなければ、きっとあのまま車に轢かれていたという。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.086.jpeg","duration":9.394489795918368,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":8.794489795918368,"slideTitle":"スライド #85","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"6CE94D5A-A325-4A6F-B8A0-F98B0DEC1C63"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_086_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 86: シーン 87","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc238754_一人部屋（日中）.jpg","telop":"私は、その症状が時折彼女に現れることを知っていて、だが、出来事が起きてから、翌朝には記憶から消えることを知っていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.087.jpeg","duration":10.646984126984126,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":10.046984126984126,"slideTitle":"スライド #86","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"79586C11-0F08-4E2E-B0BD-9265C340F417"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_087_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 87: シーン 88","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc238754_一人部屋（日中）.jpg","telop":"だが、彼女はあの後も、悪夢に悩まされていて、今日1日を無事に過ごせるかが不安だというので、励まし、私は仕事に向かった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.088.jpeg","duration":10.903242630385487,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":10.303242630385487,"slideTitle":"スライド #87","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"0E154472-86D5-48FF-A073-E8C8FCB517B6"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_088_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 88: シーン 89","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","telop":"それから、時が進み、夕陽がさしていた頃、\n彼女が突如として私が勤めている神社に現れた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.089.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","duration":8.404489795918368,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":7.804489795918367,"slideTitle":"スライド #88","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"C0922C56-56AC-447B-9FD1-027FCFEA919E"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_089_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 89: シーン 90","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","telop":"すると、彼女は、私にあることを聞いてくる。それは、以前の彼女なら気にすることもなかったはずの内容だった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.090.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","duration":9.565736961451247,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":8.965736961451247,"slideTitle":"スライド #89","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"2E41CE11-29C9-4B27-94D7-57B4768ED6E2"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_090_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 90: シーン 91","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","telop":"今考えれば、それはある予兆だったのだとわかる。\nだが、その時の私は、再度、励ます程度で済ませてしまった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.091.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第1話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","duration":9.943242630385488,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.343242630385488,"slideTitle":"スライド #90","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"D4E685FE-D2A7-48C3-A539-80CC0DC7EF7E"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_091_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 91: シーン 92","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc247230_都会の街中（夕方）.jpg","telop":"一応励ましたものの、様子が気になった私は、神社を早く出て、彼女を再度見ると、顔色が先ほどよりも悪くなっていた。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.092.jpeg","duration":10.396984126984126,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.796984126984126,"slideTitle":"スライド #91","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"BC695CC8-5833-49D8-8BFD-4824EEBEE1D0"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_092_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 92: シーン 93","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc247230_都会の街中（夕方）.jpg","telop":"そして、彼女は、ある言葉を私にいう。私は、その言葉に思わず彼女を平手打ちし、なぜそんなことを言うのかと問いただす。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.093.jpeg","duration":10.666984126984127,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":10.066984126984128,"slideTitle":"スライド #92","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"C0B73699-84BE-4422-858A-C630E5C54CE5"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_093_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 93: シーン 94","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc247230_都会の街中（夕方）.jpg","telop":"すると、彼女は、謎に笑い出し、だんだんと様子が変わっていき、まるで悩みなどなかったように笑うと、ビームを出した。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.094.jpeg","duration":9.659478458049886,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.059478458049886,"slideTitle":"スライド #93","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"33B3050B-9849-4F36-AA16-8E084270F839"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_094_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 94: シーン 95","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc247230_都会の街中（夕方）.jpg","telop":"結果的に、私は、彼女のビームを避けて、戦うことになってしまい、だんだんと周りのビル群に影響が出始めていった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.095.jpeg","duration":10.073242630385487,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.473242630385487,"slideTitle":"スライド #94","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"FBD53F8B-A943-4E82-BDA9-A5CD6280E5C8"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_095_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 95: シーン 96","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"あれから、数時間程度の間、私は彼女からのビームを避け続けていたが、それでもビームを喰らい、気づけば倒れてしまった。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.096.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":10.073242630385487,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.473242630385487,"slideTitle":"スライド #95","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"B086E385-3C58-4A19-8921-FC22893656CF"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_096_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 96: シーン 97","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"そして、目が覚めてからは、ここで時折警官と話したり、考え事をしたりしていた。そして、彼と息子の今の様子が気になる。","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.097.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":10.906984126984126,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":10.306984126984126,"slideTitle":"スライド #96","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"D1EFDE35-017A-434F-9F35-CE08C30644C2"},{"characterName":"魂魄妖夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_097_魂魄妖夢.wav","title":"シーン 97: シーン 98","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","telop":"「お待たせしました、あなたが解放されることになったので、いまから、玄関口まで私が、ご案内します。」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.098.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","duration":6.586031746031746,"voiceCharacter":"魂魄妖夢","voiceDuration":5.986031746031746,"slideTitle":"スライド #97","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E9%AD%82%E9%AD%84%E5%A6%96%E5%A4%A2","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"0B761169-BA9E-4BE2-BB10-C648C8BB3F48"},{"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_098_博麗霊夢.wav","title":"シーン 98: シーン 99","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","telop":"私がそれから外に出ると、そこには著名な建設会社の代表であるレミリアの姿があった。「あの、どうされました？」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5b.099.jpeg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","duration":9.613242630385487,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":9.013242630385488,"slideTitle":"スライド #98","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"animationName":"なし","id":"5DC2BF76-1AAB-40E5-8944-77ECE8FC7891"},{"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_099_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","title":"シーン 99: シーン 100","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"nc256639_警察署（夜）.jpg","telop":"「実は、あなたの息子さんの将来に関わることで、\n折行ってご相談がありまして…」","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第9話_4357e03f5